flowchart TD
    A[Sort candidates by strategy key] --> B[Record inputs and order steps]
    B --> C{Any candidate left}
    C -->|yes| D{Static skip reason}
    D -->|yes| E[Zero seats and skip with the static reason]
    D -->|no| F{Held quote}
    F -->|yes and fits demand and allocatable| G[Take quoted seats whole]
    F -->|yes but does not fit| H[Zero seats and skip as not chosen]
    F -->|no| I[Take the smaller of allocatable and remaining demand]
    E --> C
    G --> C
    H --> C
    I --> C
    C -->|no| J[Record result with seats and remaining demand]
